Article 23 (Orders to Grain Processing Business Operators)
When issuing an order under Article 20 of the Act to grain processing business operators, the Minister of Agriculture, Food and Rural Affairs shall determine and publicly notify the period, area, and contents of the order. <Amended 2013.3.23>

