Article 4 (Relationship with Other Statutes and Regulations)
Where other statutes or regulations cite provisions of the previous Enforcement Decree of the Grain Management Act as at the time this Decree enters into force, and this Decree contains corresponding provisions, such citations shall be deemed citations of this Decree or the corresponding provisions of this Decree in lieu of the previous provisions.

